    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=633788792825709549&sectionId=633788792876041197)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDY8Y4ErEL_text","label":"ggDY8Y4ErEL_text","default":"<p>The best image is not necessarily the most complicated one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Think about the character your child genuinely loves.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe they have a favorite hero.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe they love a funny animated character.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe there is a character they always draw.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe they have a favorite game character they talk about constantly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The more meaningful the character is to them, the more personal the finished keepsake can feel.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","label":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","default":"Turn Their Own Artwork Into Something Special"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","label":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","default":"<p>There is another fun possibility.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead of using an existing character image, why not let your child create their own?</p><p>Children can draw their own hero, animal, creature, or imaginary character and turn their artwork into a Memobrick.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This makes the finished piece even more personal because the character came directly from their imagination.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They did not simply choose a character they liked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>They created it.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","label":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","default":"A Creative Activity for Parents and Children"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","label":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","default":"<p>Building a Memobrick does not have to be something children do alone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents can join them and turn the project into quality family time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can talk about the character, look at the original image, sort the pieces, and watch the design slowly come together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For younger children, parents can handle the more difficult parts while letting them participate in placing suitable pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The finished mosaic then carries two memories: the character they loved and the time they spent creating it together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","label":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","default":"<p>A child's favorite character can be more than something they watch on a screen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It can become part of their imagination, their conversations, their drawings, and their childhood memories.</p><p>With Memobrick, you can take that favorite character and turn it into something they can build, display, and enjoy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Whether you choose a beloved character or an original creation from your child's imagination, the finished mosaic can become a special reminder of the things they loved growing up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>From screen to something they can build, their favorite character can become part of a memory they'll treasure.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","label":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","default":"Reviews from Happy Customers"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","label":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","label":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","default":"<p>-Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","label":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","label":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","default":"<p>\"I love these memo bricks! I ordered a smaller size, but when they emailed the mockup they showed me the difference of what it would look like compared to the bigger size. I was offered to upgrade\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggymABV5hia_text","label":"ggymABV5hia_text","default":"<p>-Kelsey M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","label":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","label":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;\"I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","label":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","default":"<p>-Candice L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","label":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","label":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","default":"<p>\"Excellent customer service! The design team did an excellent job and we are so pleased to have a precious family picture transformed into such a cool art form.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","label":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","default":"<p>-Aaron M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","label":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"}],
